        "text": "oversaturated, overexposed, blurry, lowres, low quality, JPEG artifacts,\nstatic image, frozen motion, slow gentle movement, peaceful, relaxed,\njerky motion, excessive camera shake, morphing, warping, flickering,\nidentity drift, face melting, anatomical distortion, deformed limbs,\nextra limbs, extra arms, extra fingers, fused fingers,\ndeformed hands, malformed face, three legs,\nbackground crowd, many background characters, chaotic background,\nsubtitles, text, watermark, inverted walking"
      },
      "color": "#223",
